X301 crypto-policy integration
==============================

Installing x301-openssl-provider activates the provider system-wide and adds
X301MLKEM1024 and X301 ahead of the selected crypto-policy TLS group list.
This is an explicit opt-in to experimental, non-standardized algorithms.

The package is not compatible with claims that FIPS, BSI, EMPTY, GOST-only or
another restrictive policy contains only its named algorithms. X301 and
X301MLKEM1024 are not FIPS validated.

Use the package helper for policy transitions:

    sudo x301-crypto-policy set DEFAULT
    sudo x301-crypto-policy set EMPTY

Direct calls to update-crypto-policies bypass this safeguard. If reconciliation
fails, do not restart OpenSSL consumers until `x301-crypto-policy reconcile`
succeeds. Restart long-running OpenSSL applications after installation,
removal, policy changes or configuration upgrades.
